{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Warudo",
    "steam_appid": 2079120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079120/extras/90717aa51e5838a249199586e4d3dc59.avif?t=1743319869\" /></div><br><br>Unleash your virtual potential with Warudo\u2014the <strong>flexible and personalized 3D VTubing software</strong> you have always wanted.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 100% free for personal use.^<br></li><li> Webcam/iPhone ARKit face tracking and hand tracking included.<br></li><li> Full body tracking with mocap suits, VR trackers or any VMC-compatible software.<br></li><li> Compatible with VRM, VRChat, or any humanoid-rigged models. Non-VRM models require an one-time export in Unity (check out our handbook!).<br></li><li> Fully customizable expressions.<br></li><li> Add your own 3D props, environments, particles, etc.<br></li><li> Native integration with livestreaming platforms, e.g. Twitch, YouTube, Bilibili.<br></li><li> Let your audience interact with your character: throw items, spawn stickers &amp; particles, launch water beams, etc.<br></li><li> Blueprint system that lets you customize anything\u2014from tracking to interactions.<br></li><li> Control your blueprints with MIDI, Stream Deck, or even WebSocket messages.<br></li><li> C# SDK for developers to add features that you desire!<br></li><li> ...I don't want to make this a super long list. Explore the rest of our features on your own!</li></ul><br>Please note that models used in the videos &amp; images are NOT necessarily included in the release.<br><br>^ We define &quot;personal use&quot; as:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> the copyrights of your VTubing persona are exclusively yours, and you possess ownership of your accounts on social/livestreaming platforms; <strong>and</strong><br></li><li> there are no contractual obligations requiring you to stream for X hours per week, unless such a contract is directly in agreement with a major livestreaming platform (e.g., Twitch, YouTube).</li></ul><br>If you would like to use Warudo commercially, please contact us at info@warudo.app.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079120/extras/90717aa51e5838a249199586e4d3dc59.avif?t=1743319869\" /></div><br><br>Unleash your virtual potential with Warudo\u2014the <strong>flexible and personalized 3D VTubing software</strong> you have always wanted.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 100% free for personal use.^<br></li><li> Webcam/iPhone ARKit face tracking and hand tracking included.<br></li><li> Full body tracking with mocap suits, VR trackers or any VMC-compatible software.<br></li><li> Compatible with VRM, VRChat, or any humanoid-rigged models. Non-VRM models require an one-time export in Unity (check out our handbook!).<br></li><li> Fully customizable expressions.<br></li><li> Add your own 3D props, environments, particles, etc.<br></li><li> Native integration with livestreaming platforms, e.g. Twitch, YouTube, Bilibili.<br></li><li> Let your audience interact with your character: throw items, spawn stickers &amp; particles, launch water beams, etc.<br></li><li> Blueprint system that lets you customize anything\u2014from tracking to interactions.<br></li><li> Control your blueprints with MIDI, Stream Deck, or even WebSocket messages.<br></li><li> C# SDK for developers to add features that you desire!<br></li><li> ...I don't want to make this a super long list. Explore the rest of our features on your own!</li></ul><br>Please note that models used in the videos &amp; images are NOT necessarily included in the release.<br><br>^ We define &quot;personal use&quot; as:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> the copyrights of your VTubing persona are exclusively yours, and you possess ownership of your accounts on social/livestreaming platforms; <strong>and</strong><br></li><li> there are no contractual obligations requiring you to stream for X hours per week, unless such a contract is directly in agreement with a major livestreaming platform (e.g., Twitch, YouTube).</li></ul><br>If you would like to use Warudo commercially, please contact us at info@warudo.app.",
    "short_description": "Warudo is the flexible &amp; personalized 3D VTubing software you have always wanted. Built-in face &amp; hand tracking, custom 3D assets, Twitch/YouTube integration, blueprint system, C# plugins, and so much more.",
